/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(1. Rigorous data validation and cleaning are prerequisites for valid downstream statistical inferences.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. Correlation does not imply causation; always inspect data context and confounders.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. Choose the median over the mean when dealing with skewed data containing significant outliers.) Tj
